---
---
<section id="features" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto scroll-mt-24">
  
  <!-- Section Title -->
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
    <span class="text-brand-peach font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-widest uppercase bg-brand-soft-pink px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-brand-peach/10">Pilares de Autocuidado</span>
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-stone-800 mt-4 mb-4">
      Tres pilares para consentirte todos los días
    </h2>
    <p class="text-stone-500 font-medium text-base sm:text-lg">
      Luna y Brillo organiza tu rutina diaria y te ayuda a conectar con tu cuerpo a través de un diseño tierno, intuitivo y minimalista.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Cards Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 sm:gap-10">
    
    <!-- Pillar 1: Monitoreo del Ciclo -->
    <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-xs p-8 rounded-[32px] border-2 border-brand-soft-pink/30 shadow-xs hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between group">
      <div>
        <!-- Icon -->
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-rose-100/70 text-rose-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-3xs group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 8.25c0-2.485-2.099-4.5-4.688-4.5-1.935 0-3.597 1.126-4.312 2.733-.715-1.607-2.377-2.733-4.313-2.733C5.1 3.75 3 5.765 3 8.25c0 7.22 9 12 9 12s9-4.78 9-12Z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-stone-800 mb-3">Monitoreo del Ciclo</h3>
        <p class="text-stone-600 font-medium text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Registra tus síntomas, sigue tu calendario menstrual y recibe predicciones confiables de tu ovulación y fase del ciclo. Diseñado para entender los ritmos naturales de tu cuerpo.
        </p>

        <!-- Bullet List -->
        <ul class="space-y-3.5 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-stone-600 font-medium">
            <span class="text-rose-400">✦</span>
            <span>Calendario lunar con predicciones inteligentes de ovulación y fertilidad.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-stone-600 font-medium">
            <span class="text-rose-400">✦</span>
            <span>Registro personalizado de 20+ síntomas y estados de ánimo con tiernos iconos.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-stone-600 font-medium">
            <span class="text-rose-400">✦</span>
            <span>Notificaciones discretas y consejos diarios adaptados a tu fase hormonal.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <a 
        href="#showcase" 
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-sm text-brand-peach group-hover:text-brand-peach-hover transition-colors mt-auto self-start"
      >
        <span>Ver simulación interactiva</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 2: Cronograma Capilar -->
    <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-xs p-8 rounded-[32px] border-2 border-brand-soft-pink/30 shadow-xs hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between group">
      <div>
        <!-- Icon -->
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-cyan-100/60 text-cyan-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-3xs group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.53 16.122A3 3 0 0 0 10.5 21.5h3a3 3 0 0 0 .97-5.378m-4.44-1.122L10.5 21.5m4.44-6.5L13.5 21.5M7.5 6L21 14m-16.5-6L18 16" />
          </svg>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-stone-800 mb-3">Cronograma Capilar</h3>
        <p class="text-stone-600 font-medium text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Un plan estructurado de cuidado para el cabello. Alterna mascarillas de Hidratación, Nutrición y Reconstrucción en base a la porosidad de tu cabello para devolverle su brillo natural.
        </p>

        <!-- Bullet List -->
        <ul class="space-y-3.5 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-stone-600 font-medium">
            <span class="text-cyan-400">✦</span>
            <span>Test de porosidad capilar interactivo integrado dentro de la aplicación.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-stone-600 font-medium">
            <span class="text-cyan-400">✦</span>
            <span>Calendario inteligente adaptado a tu tipo de hebra (lacio, rizado, tinturado).</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-stone-600 font-medium">
            <span class="text-cyan-400">✦</span>
            <span>Sugerencias de ingredientes naturales y recetas caseras súper efectivas.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <a 
        href="#showcase" 
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-sm text-brand-peach group-hover:text-brand-peach-hover transition-colors mt-auto self-start"
      >
        <span>Ver simulación interactiva</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 3: Rutinas de Skincare -->
    <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-xs p-8 rounded-[32px] border-2 border-brand-soft-pink/30 shadow-xs hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between group">
      <div>
        <!-- Icon -->
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-amber-100/60 text-amber-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-3xs group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3v2.25m6.364.386-1.591 1.591M21 12h-2.25m-.386 6.364-1.591-1.591M12 18.75V21m-4.773-4.227-1.591 1.591M5.25 12H3m4.227-4.773L5.636 5.636M15.75 12a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 1 7.5 0Z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-stone-800 mb-3">Rutinas de Skincare</h3>
        <p class="text-stone-600 font-medium text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Rutinas minimalistas y altamente eficaces para el cuidado facial diario. Configurado específicamente para pieles mixtas y sensibles, diferenciando pasos de mañana y noche.
        </p>

        <!-- Bullet List -->
        <ul class="space-y-3.5 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-stone-600 font-medium">
            <span class="text-amber-400">✦</span>
            <span>Rutina de Mañana ☀️ enfocada en proteger y retener humedad saludable.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-stone-600 font-medium">
            <span class="text-amber-400">✦</span>
            <span>Rutina de Noche 🌙 con doble limpieza y principios activos calmantes.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-stone-600 font-medium">
            <span class="text-amber-400">✦</span>
            <span>Alertas de ingredientes reactivos para evitar en pieles súper sensibles.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <a 
        href="#showcase" 
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-sm text-brand-peach group-hover:text-brand-peach-hover transition-colors mt-auto self-start"
      >
        <span>Ver simulación interactiva</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Widgets Highlight Banner below the 3-columns grid -->
  <div class="mt-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFF9F6] via-[#FCE2DB]/30 to-[#FFF9F6] p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-[36px] border-2 border-brand-soft-pink/40 shadow-xs flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
    <div class="space-y-4 max-w-2xl text-center lg:text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-soft-pink text-[10px] text-brand-peach font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>🎨 Personalización</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-stone-800">
        Widgets personalizados para tu Pantalla de Inicio 📱
      </h3>
      <p class="text-stone-600 font-medium text-sm leading-relaxed">
        ¡Lleva el control de tu bienestar directamente a la pantalla de tu móvil! Configura un hermoso widget minimalista para ver en tiempo real la fase de tu ciclo, los días restantes para tu próximo periodo, o cuándo te toca la próxima rutina capilar, todo sin abrir la app.
      </p>
      <!-- Features list for widgets -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center lg:justify-start gap-x-6 gap-y-2 pt-2 text-xs font-bold text-stone-750">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-peach">✨</span> Diseños Coquette & Minimalistas</span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-peach">✨</span> Colores dinámicos adaptables</span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-peach">✨</span> Datos en tiempo real de tu ciclo y cabello</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Visual Simulated Widget preview -->
    <div class="flex-shrink-0 bg-white p-5 rounded-[24px] border border-brand-soft-pink/50 shadow-3xs flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 w-full max-w-[280px] hover:scale-102 transition-transform duration-300 cursor-pointer">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#FCD2B3] via-[#E88A76] to-[#FFAAA6] text-white p-4 rounded-2xl w-full text-center leading-tight shadow-xs">
        <span class="block text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest font-extrabold opacity-95">Luna y Brillo</span>
        <span class="block text-lg font-extrabold mt-1">Fase Folicular</span>
        <span class="block text-[9px] mt-0.5 opacity-90 font-bold">Próximo lavado en 3 días 💧</span>
      </div>
      <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wide">Vista Previa del Widget</span>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>
